# Copy to .env and fill in, then rebuild. The Client ID is baked into the app so
# users just tap "Sign in with Google" — no setup on the phone.
# Create one (free): https://console.cloud.google.com/ -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
#   -> Create OAuth client ID -> Web application
#   -> Authorized JavaScript origins: add every origin the app is served from,
#      e.g. http://localhost:4173 and https://<your-username>.github.io
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
